        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Charging thermal tax\nPack temperature vs charge power from `signal_log`. Interruptions are counted from `DetailedChargeState` edges (`Stopped`/`NoPower`), labeled as a proxy — the SI session table carries no ended status."
